{"nodes": [{"id": "impeccable_skill_md", "label": "Impeccable Skill Entry Point (SKILL.md)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "impeccable_shared_design_laws", "label": "Impeccable Shared Design Laws", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Universal rules across brand and product registers: OKLCH color with tinted neutrals, four-step color commitment axis (Restrained/Committed/Full palette/Drenched), theme by physical scene sentence, typography hierarchy >=1.25 ratio, spacing for rhythm, motion ease-out-quart/quint/expo only. Absolute bans: side-stripe borders, gradient text, glassmorphism as default, hero-metric template, identical card grids, modal as first thought."}, {"id": "impeccable_command_table", "label": "Impeccable Command Table", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 124", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Categories: Build (craft, shape, teach, document, extract), Evaluate (critique, audit), Refine (polish, bolder, quieter, distill, harden, onboard), Enhance (animate, colorize, typeset, layout, delight, overdrive), Fix (clarify, adapt, optimize), Iterate (live)."}, {"id": "impeccable_ai_slop_test", "label": "AI Slop Test", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 111", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two-altitude check. First-order: if someone can guess theme+palette from category alone (observability->dark blue), it is training-data reflex. Second-order: if someone can guess aesthetic family from category+anti-references, it is the deeper trap. Both must be non-obvious."}], "edges": [{"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "impeccable_shared_design_laws", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 58", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "impeccable_command_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 124", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "impeccable_ai_slop_test", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 111", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "product_md_format", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "design_md_format", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "live_mode_reference", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 146", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "product_register_reference", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 54", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "impeccable_skill_md", "target": "teach_reference", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/impeccab